{
  "schema_version": "prompt-runtime.program-scenario.v1",
  "story_path": "user_stories/metrics-command-ports.md",
  "criteria": [
    {
      "id": "AC1",
      "text": "`runMetrics` with `export FILE` resolves the repository and observation time, calls `store.createBundle`, writes the serialized bundle to `FILE`, and returns `{exitCode: 0}`."
    },
    {
      "id": "AC2",
      "text": "`runMetrics` with `--json` collects repository, ledger, selector, and GitHub observations, records live observations through `store.saveEvents`, delegates calculation to `calculate.buildReport`, and writes the JSON report to `output.stdout`."
    },
    {
      "id": "AC3",
      "text": "`runMetrics` with a historical `--at` cutoff and neither `--snapshot` nor `--date` returns `{exitCode: 1}` and writes an explanatory diagnostic to `output.stderr` without querying live selector or GitHub ports."
    },
    {
      "id": "AC4",
      "text": "`runMetrics` raises `storage-unavailable` when `cwd` is blank."
    }
  ],
